(   2. Non-Linearity & Iterative Feedback Dynamics:) Tj
T*
(   - Testing a prototype frequently reveals that the team solved the wrong problem, triggering an) Tj
T*
(   immediate loop back to 'Empathize' or 'Define'.) Tj
T*
(   - Ideation sessions often expose knowledge gaps regarding technical feasibility, forcing teams) Tj
