(   [Problem Statement]: Conduct an in-depth post-mortem analysis of the commercial failure of Google Glass \(Explorer Edition\). Detail the specific failures across social empathy, user privacy, and value proposition.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Overview & Launch Hype \(2013-2014\):) Tj
T*
(   - Google Glass was an innovative heads-up display \(HUD\) equipped with a camera, optical prism) Tj
T*
(   projector, and voice recognition, launched to high-profile 'Explorers' at a $1,500 premium.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Failure of Social Empathy & Bystander Psychology:) Tj
T*
(   - Optical Recording Anxiety: The forward-facing camera lacked a definitive, tamper-proof tally) Tj
T*
(   light indicating when video was recording. Bystanders felt constantly surveilled in public) Tj
T*
(   restrooms, cinemas, cafes, and business meetings.) Tj
T*
(   - Social Stigmatization: Wearers were derisively labeled 'Glassholes', creating acute social) Tj
T*
(   friction that discouraged mainstream adoption. Empathy was extended only to the wearer,) Tj
T*
(   entirely ignoring the social context of non-wearers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Ambiguous Value Proposition & Ergonomic Deficits:) Tj
T*
(   - Unfocused Utility: Google marketed Glass as a lifestyle luxury gadget rather than identifying) Tj
T*
(   a compelling, indispensable enterprise or consumer use-case.) Tj
T*
(   - Usability Issues: Battery life barely lasted 2-3 hours during active video capture; optical) Tj
T*
(   prism caused eye strain and headaches after prolonged focus; voice commands were awkward in) Tj
T*
(   public environments.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Strategic Re-Positioning & Lessons Learned:) Tj
T*
(   - Google eventually pivoted Glass into 'Glass Enterprise Edition', focusing on warehouse) Tj
T*
(   logistics, surgical assistance, and field manufacturing where hands-free telemetry delivers) Tj
T*
(   quantified operational value.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
