BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the psychological concept of the 'Einstellung Effect' using the classic Luchins Water Jug Experiment. How does this cognitive trap manifest in legacy software refactoring projects?) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Luchins Water Jug Experiment \(1942\):) Tj
T*
(   - Abraham Luchins presented subjects with three empty water jugs of known capacities \(Jugs A,) Tj
T*
(   B, and C\) and asked them to measure out an exact target quantity of water.) Tj
T*
(   - For Problems 1 through 5, the solution uniformly required a complex formula: B - A - 2C.) Tj
T*
(   - Problem 6 could be solved via the same complex formula, but had a vastly simpler, immediate) Tj
T*
(   solution: A - C.) Tj
T*
(   - Over 80% of subjects blinded by the established mental set applied the cumbersome formula,) Tj
T*
(   and when given Problem 7 \(which could ONLY be solved via A + C\), over half declared it) Tj
T*
(   impossible!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Cognitive Mechanics:) Tj
T*
(   - The brain conserves metabolic glucose by reinforcing established neural shortcuts. Once a) Tj
T*
(   familiar schema proves successful, it exerts strong inhibitory control over exploratory neural) Tj
T*
(   pathways.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Manifestation in Legacy Software Refactoring:) Tj
T*
(   - Monolithic Persistence Traps: Developers accustomed to relational SQL databases refactor) Tj
T*
(   high-throughput event-streaming systems by shoehorning ACID relational tables with complex) Tj
T*
(   joins, oblivious to distributed append-only logs \(Kafka\) or document stores.) Tj
T*
(   - Threading over Concurrency: Engineers trained in OS-level pthreads attempt to solve) Tj
T*
(   microservice throughput bottlenecks by fine-tuning manual mutex locks, blind to reactive) Tj
T*
(   asynchronous event-loops or Go-style CSP channels.) Tj
T*
(   - Mitigation: Engaging external red-teams, employing reverse brainstorming, and enforcing) Tj
T*
(   architecture reviews from first principles.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
