T*
(   subscription metrics.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Empathetic Disconnect & Bloomberg Revelation \(2017\):) Tj
T*
(   - A Bloomberg video revealed that users could simply squeeze the proprietary juice packets with) Tj
T*
(   their bare human hands faster, with less mess, and yielding almost the exact same quantity of) Tj
T*
(   juice as the multi-thousand-dollar mechanical press!) Tj
T*
(   - The QR code scanner prevented the press from operating if the packet had 'expired' or if the) Tj
T*
(   machine lost WiFi connection, infuriating customers who owned the physical juice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Core Design Thinking Diagnostic:) Tj
T*
(   - Total failure of the Desirability lens: Engineers solved a non-existent human problem with) Tj
T*
(   extreme, costly over-engineering.) Tj
T*
(   - The team fell in love with their complex mechanical solution rather than testing whether the) Tj
T*
