T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Slow Elevator Paradigm:) Tj
T*
(   - Problem Statement: Tenants in a commercial office building complain continuously that the) Tj
T*
(   elevator is too slow, threatening lease cancellations.) Tj
T*
(   - Traditional Engineering Framing: 'How do we make the elevator physically faster?') Tj
T*
(   * Proposed Solutions: Install a higher-horsepower hoisting motor, replace physical pulley) Tj
T*
(   cables, upgrade gearboxes, or rewrite lift dispatching scheduling algorithms. These solutions) Tj
T*
(   cost hundreds of thousands of dollars and risk structural building disruption.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Reframing Breakthrough:) Tj
T*
