(   2. Symbiotic Escalation in Software Teams:) Tj
T*
(   - When a bespoke microservice framework exhibits crippling latency, architects suffering from) Tj
T*
(   confirmation bias run cherry-picked benchmarks to prove performance, while sunk cost bias) Tj
T*
(   prevents them from adopting battle-tested open-source alternatives.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Three Concrete Organizational Mitigation Rituals:) Tj
T*
(   - Pre-Mortem Exercises: Before committing to an architectural redesign, the team gathers to) Tj
T*
(   imagine it is three years in the future and the project has catastrophically collapsed. Team) Tj
T*
(   members write the failure story, surfacing hidden anxieties without career risk.) Tj
T*
(   - Independent Red-Team Architecture Audits: Subjecting major RFCs to external review panels who) Tj
T*
(   have zero equity in the legacy code and evaluate decisions purely on current technical metrics.) Tj
T*
(   - Explicit Kill Criteria: Establishing quantifiable milestone metrics upfront \(e.g., 'If) Tj
T*
(   latency does not drop below 50ms at 10,000 QPS by Month 4, this custom cache project is) Tj
T*
(   permanently decommissioned'\).) Tj
